TITLE:: GridSlider
SUMMARY:: Vertical slider drawn as one view growing over another.
CATEGORIES:: GUI>Views
RELATED:: Classes/BorderView, Classes/Color, Classes/DrumStep, Classes/SCViewHolder, Classes/View

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::GridSlider:: is a LINK::Classes/SCViewHolder::. The bottom layer is a LINK::Classes/BorderView::. A second LINK::Classes/View:: sits on top of it, aligned to the bottom, and grows upward. Value CODE::1:: fills the area inside the border. Value CODE::0:: gives that top view no height, so only the bottom colour shows. The parent of the top view has no layout; its rectangle is set from the value. A border insets the top view by the border width so the top view does not paint over the outline.

The top of the inner area is value CODE::1:: and the bottom pixel is value CODE::0::. A left press and a left drag both set the value from the pointer, including when the pointer leaves the control. A right press calls the right-click function and does not change the value.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a slider at value CODE::0::.

ARGUMENT:: bottomColour
The LINK::Classes/Color:: of the bottom layer.

ARGUMENT:: topColour
The LINK::Classes/Color:: of the top view.

ARGUMENT:: action
Called with the new value after a left press or left drag. May be CODE::nil::.

ARGUMENT:: rightClickAction
Called on a right press. May be CODE::nil::.

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::GridSlider:: instance.

METHOD:: valueForY
Maps a vertical pointer position to a value from CODE::0:: to CODE::1::.

ARGUMENT:: y
Distance from the top of the control, in pixels.

ARGUMENT:: height
Height of the control, in pixels.

ARGUMENT:: inset
Border inset, in pixels. The track is the area inside this inset. The default is CODE::0::.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber:: from CODE::0:: to CODE::1::. The top of the track is CODE::1:: and its bottom pixel is CODE::0::. Positions outside the track are clipped.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: borderColour
The outline colour.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Color::.

METHOD:: borderColour_
Sets the outline colour on the bottom layer.

ARGUMENT:: colour
A LINK::Classes/Color::.

METHOD:: borderWidth
The outline width in pixels.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::.

METHOD:: borderWidth_
Sets the outline width and insets the top view by that many pixels.

ARGUMENT:: width
Width in pixels.

METHOD:: value
The current value, from CODE::0:: to CODE::1::.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::.

METHOD:: value_
Sets the value and updates the top view. Values below CODE::0:: or above CODE::1:: are clipped. This does not call the left-drag action.

ARGUMENT:: value
A LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::.

PRIVATE:: init, prApplyPointer, prInstallMouse, prLayoutTop, prOnMouseDown, prOnMouseMove, prOnMouseUp
